# Transient submission artifact, written by devtools::submit_cran() and consumed
# (then deleted) by usethis::use_github_release(). It must never be committed:
# it is generated from `main` at submission time and the durable record of the
# submitted SHA is the GitHub release / tag, not a tracked file. Ignored so no
# feature branch can sweep it in via `git add .`. See dev/README.md, "CRAN-SUBMISSION".
# Deliberate exception, if ever needed: `git add -f CRAN-SUBMISSION`.
/CRAN-SUBMISSION
